The price of the discount!
Redisposal of the “pay-as-you-go” in Nanjing City - China New Network
In an interview with Yanko Evening News (journalist Marubo) Janko Evening/Uchio Journalist 10, it was found that the price-fixing agreement, which had not been seen for more than a decade, had returned to Nanjing City, and that a building located in the Jiangbei Xinjiang district declared that it was “payable for the difference” and that other sources of housing before the transfer were more favourable than the previous discount, and that the developers were willing to change the house for the buyer and refund the difference.
There are a number of terms of a “price agreement”
This building, located in the Jiangbei Xinjiang district, is called Polyjanzi Clouds, and Mr. Sun, the houseman, told the journalist that he had found a “declaration” while he was shopping last weekend.
The pictures he sent to the press showed that the developers of the building promised to change their premises from the date of the purchase and sale contract to the respective source if the other sources of the project had a discount greater than the previous discount on the purchase of the premises (same type of house, same building, same unit, same property type as other unsold merchandise), and to return the difference.
According to Mr. Sun, the replacement consultant said that it was actually a “priority agreement” to reassure buyers not to worry about the development business’s promotion, “it’s time to cut the price if you want to buy it, there is no time to go to the shop, and it is true that if you don’t want to do so”.
A number of other home buyers argue that the “price agreement” is a “cardio” for home buyers, but that the conditions are not low.
Ms. Chung, who intended to buy a new house in Jiangbei, said that the “threshold” was still quite high, since the guaranteed source was first of all the same type of house and had to be in the same building, the same unit, and the buyers had very few sources of affordable housing.
There are also home buyers who believe that, because of information asymmetries, sales do not preclude the granting of additional concessions, and that it is difficult for buyers to “maintain” rights.
It remains to be seen whether the buyer can be retained.
In November of last year, journalists consulted online real estate in Nanjing to learn that the building had been licensed for a total of 252 housing units in two of the chief ' s buildings, with a total size of 105 square metres, 114 square metres and 129 square metres, etc., with an average price of 39,843 yuan/m2 for full renovation.
However, more than two months ago, online real estate showed a total of 157 unsold sets, or 62.3 per cent, of the current stock of the building, with a total of 128 units in building 8, 113 units in total, 44 units in 124 units in building 7, and a total of 33 sets in total, or only 13 per cent.
Marketers reported that the “pricing agreement” had also appeared in Nanjing in 2008.
In August of that year, in order to attract the eyes of the buyers, the river ' s Yellow Hill Road ' s building to the bottom of the pond 'Silvering Plan' was launched, which reads as follows: “The company solemnly undertakes to return the difference to the old owner if the margin of preference for the project is increased during the year”.
Subsequently, in April 2011, nine other buildings in Nanjing committed themselves to “pay for the difference”.
“The city of the building is warming, and at this time it needs a `heavy heart agent'.
Mr. Shen, a senior executive in the Nanjing real estate industry, stated that the “price agreement” was also one of the ways in which housing enterprises were marketed.
In his view, developing firms now needed more confidence than buyers, and the introduction of “price agreements” was in fact serving as a boost.
As to the ability to retain buyers, he said that it depended on the influence of multiple factors, such as regulatory policies, loan thresholds and so on, which remained to be seen at the present time.
The Chinese rescue team continued its rescue operation in Turkey.
According to the Ministry of Emergency Management website on 11 February, on 10 February, three operational units and 45 rescue teams from the Chinese rescue team, which was in the process of being rescued in Turkey, were dispatched to rescue a detainee.
At the same time, two search and assessment teams were dispatched to conduct an assessment and screening of 15 buildings on Vodabash Street.
To date, a total of four trapped persons have been rescued, five victims have been searched and 25 severely collapsed buildings have been subjected to vital signs and risk assessments.
The rescue teams will make scientific adjustments in response to the actual situation on the ground in the affected areas and will continue their efforts in depth.
Rescue teams obtain rescue help information through a variety of channels, including embassies, local governments and United Nations relief organizations, and are verified on a case-by-case basis by means of on-line enquiries, on-site searches, etc.
The rescue team in Hong Kong, China, was briefed on the current rescue environment and the collapse of buildings, and conducted joint search operations.
Currently, regional coordination (SSC5) is under the joint responsibility of the Italian rescue team, with the simultaneous deployment of three personnel to the Regional Rescue Coordination Centre No. 5, to communicate with a number of teams, including Italy, the United Kingdom, Serbia, Slovakia and Oman, and to learn about the response of United Nations relief organizations and national teams.
The teams have continued to strengthen security management and team security, to strengthen security controls on relief sites, to strengthen rescue discipline and to clarify security concerns, in accordance with the principle of unity of command and security first.
Operation of a system of rotational readiness and outposting on an ongoing basis and enhancement of camp security management.
The medical staff of the rescue team provide daily medical screening services to members of the team, strengthen the medical security of key personnel, and are now in full health and carrying out the killing of the camp.
Since the establishment of the camp, the logistics support team has constructed a total of four major types of 26 field tents, such as command communications, equipment storage, medical dissipation, living accommodation and canine quarters, to secure an on-site rescue kit of more than 30 units.
Kim Jong-un's father and daughter interacted with each other.
On the evening of the 8th day of the Democratic People ' s Republic of Korea, the 75th anniversary of the Military Establishment Section was observed, and Kim Jong-un ' s daughter Kim ' s love not only attended but also stood on the podium with his father.
On 9 September, the Korean media released a film in which the Kim loved to be close to his father, to look at him and whisper several times, and she held his cheeks lightly with her hands and even touched him in the chest, and the father and daughter interacted with him to the top of the country.
However, the First Lady, Lord Li Shei, could only step aside.
In a combination of Korean “Korea News” and other reports, Kim Jong-un and Lord Li Shei, in an official photo taken with their daughter Kim's love to attend dinner on seven days, not only did Kim's love rarely sit in the middle of his parents' table C, she joined Kim Jong-un on the 75th anniversary of the military section the following night.
After the release of the military-style video by the Korean official medium “North Korean Central Television”, more images of the love of the father and the daughter were exposed.
Kim Jong-un looked at his daughter several times on the podium, the smiles on both faces never retreated and whispered in each other's ears, and Kim loved to hold his father's cheeks with his hands, and Kim Jong-un responded with a grinning smile.
Other media images also show that King's love and Kim Jong-un, while sitting on their indoor couches, constantly touch their father's face with their hands; while she and her father walk with their hands, they touch Kim Jong-un's chest with their hands.
The First Lady, Li Shei, had to walk behind her back or sit by her side, always a few steps away from her husband and daughter.
The Korean media have pointed out that King Kim loves to be the fifth in a formal setting in the three months since the first public appearance of the Mars 17 missile test on 18 November last year.
In referring to Kim's love, the Korean media used the highest name, such as his dearest son, his noble son, and also aired fragments of his love overlooking the march of the army, chanting back and forth in favour of the white-headed lineage.
These signs cast doubt on whether Kim's love has been identified as the heir to the Kim regime, and the Washington Post analysis suggests that “this is Kim Jong-un's signal to bring her high school-age daughter to the status of successor”, although there is also the view that such a determination is still premature and that in the case of Kim Jong-un's son on his knees, there are various possibilities.
"Fund E Account" is here: the SEC has authorized the development of a collection and search of all funds in the name of investors - Economic Watch - a professional financial news site.
Economics Watch, journalists, Chen San, the plethora of channels for the purchase of funds makes it difficult to collect account information?
Do you always forget "small vaults"?
These issues of Ki-min are about to be resolved.
On 10 February, the CSRC announced that the Fund E account APP had been set up in mobile phone applications stores and had run public trials.
The “Fund E account” was described as providing a “one-stop” search service for individual investors for information on the accounts and shares of public funds, with the aim of addressing the distress points of industry services such as missing accounts and cumbersome inquiries by large, small and medium-sized investors.
According to Wind data, by the end of 2022 there were 156 public fund managers in the country, managing about $26 trillion in size; 167 public fund share registers and 411 public fund sales agencies.
The system of accounts of the various quota registers is independent of each other and lacks uniform access to the industry.
According to industry, at the end of 2021 more than 720 million investors in our Fund, i.e., half of the country ' s population invested in the Fund ' s products.
Previously, investors were required to search for purchases through different sales agencies, while the “fund E account” provided access to all sales channels, and the holding of funds was clear.
What is the “Fund E Account” APP?
According to the relevant documents, the Fund's E Account APP is a one-stop shop application for China's clearing and development of a PFP industry portal approved by the CSRC to provide investors with off-site shares of PGF products.
Investors can improve the efficiency of their inquiries across the board by facilitating and fast-tracking the holding of off-site shares of PGF products purchased by their respective fund managers through the sales channels of the market as a whole.
Specifically, information available to investors through the “Fund E account” includes information on fund accounts maintained by fund administrators throughout the market, information on transaction accounts opened by fund sales agencies, and off-site share holdings of products, including publicly collected equity investment funds and pooled asset management schemes, which are not limited to 200 investors established by securities companies.
Liu Yakchi, Officer-in-Charge of the Shanghai Securities Fund Evaluation and Research Centre, stated to Economic Watch journalists that investors could obtain information on all their out-of-the-office fund holdings through the “Fund E account” App one-stop shop to help them recover “forgotten assets” and, more importantly, to bring together the full account information on the investments of the Consolidated Fund for clients, and to help clients gain a more timely, accurate and complete picture of their investments, thereby improving their portfolio allocation and planning their own financial arrangements.
How do you register for use?
Journalists note that the Fund's account E APP is currently on board in mobile phone applications such as Chinese, Apple, Mi, OPPO and vivo, but that the APP is still in the public trial phase and registration requires an invitation code, which is available to investors in contact with the fund manager of the fund in which it is held.
A six-digit invitation code was given to an economic watch reporter by a large Chinese public fund in Shanghai, and the journalist was told that “China's settlement provides a certain number of invitations to each fund manager during the APP trial operation, and investors call and we will provide them.
When the test runs are completed, the user registration will be opened without the invitation number.
I'm not sure what I'm going to do.
Journalists registered their accounts and completed their inquiries on the basis of the “Fund E account” published by the network of CSROs and using the relevant documentation. The process took only a few minutes and was divided into four main steps: user registration, real name certification, fund account binding, and fund-raising inquiries.
After the physical name certification step, click on the “assets” fund binding button, and all Fund products purchased by journalists through the respective fund sales platforms are presented in the binding options list (a binding account), and the binding is completed so that the total assets of the invested fund can be viewed directly and the query function can be started.
It is worth noting that the “Fund E account” provides a search service only for investors and does not allow for foreclosure.
The data date shown in Fund E accounts is generally the date on which the user made a query (T-day) and three transaction days forward.
For example, the Fund E account was opened on 10 February, and the corresponding date for total assets, fund shares and net value of funds shown on the asset sheet was three transaction days forward, that is, 7 February.
