Member, alternate member and chief executive officer of the NJC and the provincial ministerial departments completed a 20-year seminar on the implementation of Xi Jinping’s socialist ideas and the Party’s spirit of Chinese identity in the new era
2023-02-11 13:07:20 [Source: Xinhua Society] [Commander: Li Xinhua] Font: [Main and Medium]
On 10 February, members, alternates and leading officials of the Xi Jinping Central Committee of Xinhua, Xinhua Society, Xinhua, completed their studies at the Central Party School (National School of Administration) in the afternoon of the Xi Jinping Xinping Xinping Xianxing Party’s 20th spiritual workshop, which was attended by Chai Qi, Permanent Committee of the Central Political Bureau of the Chinese Communist Party and Secretary of the Central Registry, who made concluding remarks.
He expressed the need to follow through on the important words of the Secretary-General of Xi Jinping at the beginning of the workshop, to be more committed to the “two established” and to the “two maintained”, to strengthen his skills, to work hard, to promote modern Chinese-style efforts and to create performances that could withstand historical, practical and popular tests in the overall construction of a modern socialist State and the comprehensive promotion of the great renaissance of the Chinese nation.
During the course of the seminar, all the participants, guided by the socialist ideas of the Chinese identity of Xi Jinping ' s new era, carefully studied the party ' s 20 main spirits and the important remarks of Xi Jinping ' s General Secretary at the beginning of the workshop, engaged in an in-depth discussion and exchange, deepened their understanding of a range of major theoretical and practical issues related to modern China, strengthened their confidence and determination to promote the great revival of the Chinese nation under the strong central leadership of the party, with Xi Jinping at its core, and strengthened their sense of responsibility and purpose in carrying out their duties, doing good work and ensuring a good start in the new era.
At the completion of the workshop, 10 participants took the floor and shared the learning gains.
Chai Chi stated that learning to implement the Xi Jinping new era's socialist ideology and the spirit of the Party is both a political priority for the present and for the coming period, and a long-term strategic task, which is to promote learning and implementation in keeping with the requirements of “comprehensive learning, comprehensive management and full implementation”.
A deeper understanding of the decisive importance of the “two established” is needed, as is a firm commitment to uphold the central position of Xi Jinping's General Secretary, to uphold the party's central authority and to consolidate its leadership, to constantly improve its political judgement, political awareness and political implementation, and to maintain a high degree of political consistency with the party's centre, which is centred on Comrade Xi Jinping, in its intellectual and political actions.
To try to master the mastery of Marxist theory, to use the Party ' s innovative theory to arm its minds, guide its practice, promote its work, learn from it, learn from it, learn from it, learn from it, learn from it and learn from it its mission.
In order to implement the 20 decisions of the good party in a spirit of determination, the Chinese-style modernization should be promoted firmly, the sleeves should be lifted up and dry, the body should be put down as a “construction leader” and the blueprint should be translated into reality one step at a time.
It is important to bear in mind that the ruling party is always on its way, that the party ' s self-revolution is always on its way, that it is on its way, that it is on its path, that it is on its path, and that it is on its path, that it is on its path, that it is on its own, that it is on its path, that it is on its own, that it is on its own, that it is on its own, that it is on its own, and that it is on its own, and that it is on its own, that it is on its way.
To enhance the promotion of high-quality development skills, to serve the general public, and to prevent risk-mitigating skills, research and research efforts should be made to prevent and overcome formalism and bureaucracy.
Ishi Tae Feng, Li Gang Jie, Li Shui, Chen Wenqing, Liu Jin Guo and Wang Xiaohong attended the closing ceremony and Chen Shi presided over the closing ceremony.
Viet Nam's official visit to Singapore and Brunei by the Prime Minister of Viet Nam, Fan Mingjing and the couple, was successful and produced comprehensive, practical and concrete results, as reported by the News Agency Hanoi-Viet Nam special reporter.
During the three days of the mission to Singapore and Brunei, Prime Minister Fan Mingjing participated in more than 30 different events.
The results achieved have given new impetus to the development of the new two-State strategic partnership and the Viet Nam comprehensive partnership in a deeper, broader and more effective direction.
During his visit to both countries, Prime Minister Fan Mingjing continued to reaffirm the Viet Nam Party and the country ' s external routes, namely independence, pluralism and change, and was ready to be good friends and reliable partners for all countries, as well as responsible members of the international community.
Strengthened relations with Singapore and Brunei are the needs of their respective countries, committed to the well-being of their peoples and to peace, stability and development in the region and the world.
At the various meetings and talks, Prime Minister Fan Mingjing and the leaders of Singapore and Brunei agreed to continuously enhance political mutual trust with Viet Nam through visits by high-level delegations, effective bilateral cooperation mechanisms and important cooperation agreements.
A number of cooperation documents were signed during the visit.
Of these, the Memorandum of Understanding on the Green and Digital Economy Partnership with Singapore and the Plan of Action for the Strengthening of the Viet Nam Comprehensive Partnership for the Period 2023-2027 with Brunei are two highlights.
Viet Nam signed a memorandum of understanding on the Green and Digital Economy Partnership with Singapore.
I can't believe I'm here.
During meetings with business leaders, seminars or participation in economic forums, Prime Minister Fan Mingjing stressed that Viet Nam welcomed and facilitated the expansion of investment by Singapore and Brunei enterprises in areas such as digital transformation, green energy, high technology and innovation in Viet Nam.
The visit not only helped to deepen Viet Nam ' s cooperation with Singapore and Brunei in traditional areas such as politics, diplomacy, economy, security, defence, education and training, hydrocarbons, tourism and civic exchanges, but also created cooperation frameworks for countries in new potential areas such as the digital economy, green economy, energy transformation, innovation, smart cities and sustainable development.
King Hassanal Bolkiah of Brunei and Prime Minister Fan Ming are preparing for a bilateral symposium.
I can't believe I'm here.
During his visits to both countries, Prime Minister Fan Mingjing arranged to visit and listen to the thoughts and aspirations of the local Vietnamese community.
During the meeting between the leaders of both countries, Prime Minister Fan Mingjing recommended that the authorities of both countries pay more attention and create favourable conditions for the local Vietnamese community to be treated fairly, to have an opportunity to contribute to local society and to foster relations between the two countries.
This proposal was endorsed and supported by the leaders of both countries.
In particular, Prime Minister Fan Mingzhing also shared with the leaders of the two countries their aspirations for an ASEAN community of solidarity, peace, stability and prosperity; and agreed to maintain solidarity and collaboration with the ASEAN countries and to enhance the central role of ASEAN in the context of the complex and volatile regional and international situation.
With the important results achieved, Prime Minister Fan Mingjing's official visit to Singapore and Brunei has made a positive contribution to the effective implementation of the 13-year Viet Nam-wide external route to strengthen relations with ASEAN neighbours, to the effective implementation of Conclusion No. 12 (12-KL/TW) of the Central Political Bureau of Viet Nam on Viet Nam's diaspora work in the new situation, and to the full force of national unity.
(concluded)
And what is the object that was shot down?
There's a lot of speculation.
The U.S. military again used U.S. state-of-the-art invisible jet F-22 in the afternoon of Friday (10 February) to shoot down an unidentified object flying airbornely in U.S. Alaska.
The shooting took place 10 miles from the Alaskan coast.
This is the second time in less than a week that the United States forces have shot down an aerial object.
Last Saturday, a spy balloon from China drifted over United States airspace and was destroyed several days later near the coast of South Carolina, United States.
According to the Pentagon, the second shot-down object entered United States airspace for the first time on Thursday night and was followed by the United States military as it moved over north-east Alaska at an altitude of 12,000 metres (40,000 feet) similar to a small car and much smaller than the Chinese spy balloon that was previously shot down.
The Pentagon also considered that there was no indication that the object was manoeuvrable at the present time.
The White House National Security Council strategic communication coordinator, John Kirby, stated on Friday that, while the specifics of the object flying at high altitude were not yet clear, it posed “a reasonable threat to the safety of civil aviation aircraft”.
Corby indicated that, unlike the spy balloon found in the United States, the object did not have a payload on it.
Kirby said, “We call it an `object' that is the best description we can make today”.
President Biden heard the advice of the Pentagon before ordering the shooting down of the object, which he took was “very cautious”, added by Kirby.
The official description of the object in the United States can be broadly summarized as the size of a car with no handler, no hanger and an altitude of about 10,000 metres.
However, the information could not answer basic questions, such as what the object was, what country it belonged to and what task it was carrying out.
There are many analyses and speculations on the Internet that this could be another Chinese balloon.
It may come from China, like the spy balloon that invaded American airspace and the Chinese balloon that floated over Latin America, and they perform certain missions in different locations.
This “object” in Alaska was also associated with the “unknown flight object” (UFO).
The story of the United States Newsweek quotes former United States Congressman Peter Meijer's tweet on Friday, saying, “It's true hope that this `unknown flyer' is also a spy balloon, not a legitimate UFO”.
“The irony of mixing alien spaceships with meteorological balloons is surprising, but it is not worth triggering an interstellar conflict,” said Major.
Major sent this tweet shortly after Kirby confirmed that the object in Alaska had been shot down.
According to Newsweek, the object was suspected of being a UFO and not just a Major.
Tim Burchett, Congressman of the Republican Party of Tennessee, criticized the Government's practice of concealing information last month and asked the Office of the Director-General of National Intelligence (DNI) to publish reports on “unknown flying objects”.
Iran commemorates the anniversary of the revolution.
The Islamic Republic of Iran held an official gathering on Saturday to commemorate the 44th anniversary of the Iranian revolution, but anti-government hackers briefly interrupted President Ibrahim Lacey ' s televised speech.
The President's televised speech was interrupted on the Internet for about a minute, and a group of anti-Iranian hackers, named “Edalat Ali (Ali Justice),” appeared on the screen.
There was also a voice chanting “Die to the Islamic Republic”.
According to Reuters today, Iran commemorates the anniversary of the revolution and hackers interrupt national television coverage.
While the Iranian authorities officially commemorated the 44th anniversary of the Iranian revolution, the hard-line Government of Lacey faced the most daunting challenge of demanding that young protesters step down, Lacey still called for “swindling youth” to repent so that they could be pardoned by the highest Iranian leadership.
Following the death in September of Amini Mahsa Amini, 22, in the custody of the country ' s moral police, nationwide protests continued in Iran.
The deadly repression of protests by Iranian security forces has been one of the most powerful challenges facing the Islamic Republic since the revolution of 1979, when the 2500-year monarchy was overthrown.
As part of the amnesty to commemorate the anniversary of the revolution, the Iranian authorities released on Friday the imprisoned dissident Fahd Mesami and the Iranian-French scholar Fariba Adelha, who were on hunger strike.
Earlier, Supreme Leader Ayatollah Ali Khamenei (Ayatollah Ali Khamenei) had issued an amnesty, which included a number of prisoners who had been arrested during recent anti-Government protests.
According to the human rights organization HRANA, 528 protesters, including 71 minors, had been killed as of Friday.
A further 70 Government security personnel were reportedly killed.
As many as 19,763 protesters are believed to have been arrested.
For several weeks, Iranian leaders and the official media have called for a vote at Saturday ' s rally to demonstrate their opposition to protests and support for the Government.
On Friday night, on the anniversary of the Iranian revolution, the official media showed fireworks as part of the government-sponsored celebrations, chanting “Allahu Akbar!”
God is the greatest!"
However, the rally also heard many shouting, "Death to the dictator!"
"The Death of the Islamic Republic" in social media videos.
On Saturday, Government television broadcast live videos of official meetings in all states of the country.
In Tehran, as part of the official celebrations, the national production of anti-ballistic missiles, drones, anti-submarine cruisers and other military equipment was demonstrated.
President Lacey's speech was frequently interrupted by the slogan “Die America” — a signpost at a state rally.
The crowd also shouted “Death to Israel”.
Reuters states that Adelkhah, who has been in prison since 2019, is one of the seven French nationals detained in Iran, a factor that has contributed to the deterioration of relations between Paris and Tehran in recent months.
She was sentenced to five years ' imprisonment in 2020 on charges of national security.
They later placed her under house arrest, but in January she returned to prison.
Adelkhah denied these allegations.
A week before his release, his supporters warned that he was at risk of death as a result of a hunger strike.
He was arrested in 2018 for protesting against the forced wearing of a headscarf.
The French Ministry of Foreign Affairs, in response to the release of Adelkhah on Friday, called for the restoration of her freedom “including that she should be allowed to return to France if she so wishes.
